<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">CC all new service team members&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">Attach new client contact sheet</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Good morning/afternoon [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">client name</span>]</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>We are excited to be working with you; I've attached a contact sheet with your new service team's contact information. We've&nbsp; met with <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[previous service team name(s)]</span> to understand your business, goals, and projects worked on to date. <br><br>I'd like to schedule time to meet your team and discuss what is on the horizon for the remainder of&nbsp; [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">current year</span>] and also&nbsp; look forward to&nbsp; <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[following year]</span> and beyond. <br><br>Are you available on [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">insert date and time</span>] for approximately 60-90 minutes? If no please suggest alternate times and I'll send a calendar invitation. <br><br>We thank you in advance for forwarding this on to anyone else in your organization who should be aware of a service team change.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>We look forward to hearing from you soon and look forward to our partnership.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>